		(property "Description" "Battery-voltage monitor divider (R11 high side to VBAT, R12 low side to GND, tap to a NINA-B400 analog-capable GPIO). 1M/1M halves VBAT's 4.2V full-charge to 2.1V, safely inside the nRF52833 SAADC range at a 3.3V reference. TRADEOFF WORTH KNOWING: 4.2V/2M = ~2.1uA continuous, which is comparable to the module's own ~2.6uA System ON sleep current (UBX-19049405 R09 Table 12) -- i.e. this divider roughly doubles standby drain. If runtime matters more than always-on battery reporting, gate the divider's low side with a small FET driven by a GPIO and sample on demand."
			(at 251.46 195.58 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
