		(property "Description" "ADC sampling capacitor across R12, stabilising the 1M/1M divider tap for the nRF52833 SAADC. The divider's ~500k source impedance is high for the SAADC, so this reservoir plus a long acquisition time setting in firmware is what makes the reading accurate."
			(at 274.32 201.93 0)
